pps/578310/extras/1424c6e4790bfcadbd8641827d92a99b.avif?t=1604127364\" width=600 height=130 /></span><br><br>► <strong>CUSTOM LOADOUT.</strong><br>Brain / Out offers a wide range of weapons — both NATO and Warsaw Pact rifles, shotguns, pistols, sniper rifles and melee weapons.<br>**************************************************************<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/578310/extras/5b3d619d296c8adb1a0a6ba2d392df6f.avif?t=1604127364\" width=600 height=130 /></span><br><br>► <strong>MODIFY AND UPGRADE.</strong><br>Improve your weapon stats and upgrade the level of your favorite weapons with different parts — scopes, handles, barrels, receivers, mounts and bars. Collect and disassemble trophies to get new parts and improve your Tech level. <br>**************************************************************<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/578310/extras/e93b60cf7cfbb625464e5922ed847707.avif?t=1604127364\" width=600 height=130 /></span><br><br>► <strong>ADDITIONAL EQUIPMENT.</strong><br>Use special equipment to survive a bit longer. Bulletproof vests and helmets, stun and frag grenades, under-barrel grenade launchers, anti-personnel mines and more.<br>**************************************************************<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/578310/extras/d9f827b2736913a5d120a95962358a8c.avif?t=1604127364\" width=600 height=130 /></span><br><br>► <strong>CLIMB THE SKILL LADDER.</strong><br>The better you fight, the more weapons you get! Get to the TOP 100 and receive a unique weapon set.", "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/578310/extras/0a3c4deba40650701bca830dbf